{"ref":"BDB, עֲרֵמָה","hw":"עֲרֵמָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֲרֵמָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. heap</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 3:7\" href=\"/Ruth.3.7\">Ru 3:7</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲרֵמַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Haggai 2:16\" href=\"/Haggai.2.16\">Hg 2:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 7:3\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.7.3\">Ct 7:3</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲרֵמוֹת</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:15\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.15\">Ne 13:15</a> +, cstr. 3:34; abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲרֵמִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:26\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.26\">Je 50:26</a>;—<em>heap</em> of rubbish <span dir=\"rtl\">(עָפָר)</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:34\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.34\">Ne 3:34</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> = ruin-heap <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:26\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.26\">Je 50:26</a>; = grain-heap (of threshed grain, <span dir=\"rtl\">عَرَمَةٌ</span> unthreshed, according to Wetzst<sup>l.c.</sup>), <a data-ref=\"Haggai 2:16\" href=\"/Haggai.2.16\">Hg 2:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:15\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.15\">Ne 13:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ruth 3:7\" href=\"/Ruth.3.7\">Ru 3:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ חִטִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 7:3\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.7.3\">Ct 7:3</a>; of grain and fruit <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.6\">2 Ch 31:6</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:7\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.9\">9</a>.","next":"BDB, ערם","prev":"BDB, עָרַם"}